{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Creator is a profession that uses items to fight. By killing monsters and dropping items, collecting items, creating items, building your own territory, and defending against monster sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the trap-ejection board can set the ejection direction and distance through two boards to relay ejection to kill monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/a2a1aaaa42868bbfa708b66b7c4a86c7.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/a2a1aaaa42868bbfa708b66b7c4a86c7.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/a2a1aaaa42868bbfa708b66b7c4a86c7.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the mechanism-flywheel can launch a flywheel back and forth 8 meters in front of itself, and will damage and bleed the monsters that collide during the flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/1aa30cbecfe0b566c2762865f4ab7f9d.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=412 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/1aa30cbecfe0b566c2762865f4ab7f9d.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/1aa30cbecfe0b566c2762865f4ab7f9d.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the mechanism-ejection ball can perform up to 5 relay ejection damage to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/5a17183bc4d80f123d9fda0d118a9d01.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=412 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/5a17183bc4d80f123d9fda0d118a9d01.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/5a17183bc4d80f123d9fda0d118a9d01.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the power grid tower can form a lightning array with other power grid towers to use thunder balls to attack the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/4baa5db37ea1cc8244da91c4be070274.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=412 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/4baa5db37ea1cc8244da91c4be070274.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/4baa5db37ea1cc8244da91c4be070274.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the flying sword tower can shuttle like a swimming fish and kill the enemy quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"kill monster 9","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/09e5121223e85040331cbee8119b1a9c7d44c7f4.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 99","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/e265849bba5bc315da4c75129add2f2a5198b103.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 999","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/ec773b1fdd9e01dd565a427b10a1e9d05528547c.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 9999","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/4a2c39f0e9b5e054432a64bb397b29881720f142.jpg"},{"name":"kill monster 99999","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3183400/ecca0918b384cf83df211569e02a3eff0fbfad37.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183400?t=1772783598","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/a24830877a277209fd6a5b617632a2c951e1f350/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772783598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/336401b22b859f157402b14ccaa6379b8f5b4d8f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772783598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/336401b22b859f157402b14ccaa6379b8f5b4d8f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772783598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Creator is a profession that uses items to fight. By killing monsters and dropping items, collecting items, creating items, building your own territory, and defending against monster sieges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the trap-ejection board can set the ejection direction and distance through two boards to relay ejection to kill monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/a2a1aaaa42868bbfa708b66b7c4a86c7.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/a2a1aaaa42868bbfa708b66b7c4a86c7.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/a2a1aaaa42868bbfa708b66b7c4a86c7.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the mechanism-flywheel can launch a flywheel back and forth 8 meters in front of itself, and will damage and bleed the monsters that collide during the flight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/1aa30cbecfe0b566c2762865f4ab7f9d.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=412 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/1aa30cbecfe0b566c2762865f4ab7f9d.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/1aa30cbecfe0b566c2762865f4ab7f9d.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the mechanism-ejection ball can perform up to 5 relay ejection damage to monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/5a17183bc4d80f123d9fda0d118a9d01.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=412 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/5a17183bc4d80f123d9fda0d118a9d01.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/5a17183bc4d80f123d9fda0d118a9d01.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the power grid tower can form a lightning array with other power grid towers to use thunder balls to attack the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/4baa5db37ea1cc8244da91c4be070274.poster.avif?t=1772783598\" width=412 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/4baa5db37ea1cc8244da91c4be070274.webm?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/extras/4baa5db37ea1cc8244da91c4be070274.mp4?t=1772783598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For example, the flying sword tower can shuttle like a swimming fish and kill the enemy quickly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["icon123"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183400/21c1e06ca9e4a2c0e5b30334a7b0fb26eda5328e/header.jpg?t=1772783598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3183400/271330596/a76552ef25824f654eba97d2be5af31f